<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian inquiry recommends banking shake-up.</title>
<headline>Australian inquiry recommends banking shake-up.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An official Australian inquiry on Wednesday recommended sweeping reforms to the country's financial system, including the easing of restricts on bank mergers and takeovers.</p>
<p>The Financial System Inquiry also recommended an easing of rules governing foreign ownership of Australia's largest banks.</p>
